close_reason: Typed WebSocket integration intelligence shipped through PR #85 as master commit 8177c0c; release publication remains maintainer-controlled.
body: "Home Assistant Core 2026.8.0 provides stable WebSocket contracts for manifest/list, manifest/get, integration/setup_info, integration/descriptions, integration/wait, entity/source, and slugify. The current CLI supports these only through raw ws call. This feature adds a discoverable typed surface with bounded output and preserves generic passthrough for integration-defined evolution."
